---
description: >-
  Central connections with `autonumber both`. Every circle sits between the
  number and the line, for each variant and in both directions.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber both
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  Alice->>()Bob: Circle at receiver
  Bob->>()Alice: Circle at receiver, right to left
  Alice()->>Bob: Circle at sender
  Bob()->>Alice: Circle at sender, right to left
  Alice()->>()Bob: Circle at both ends
  Bob()->>()Alice: Circle at both ends, right to left
  Bob/|-()Alice: Reverse, circle on the tail
  Alice()/|-Bob: Reverse, circle on the head
  Alice()<<->>()Bob: Bidirectional, circle at both ends
  Alice->>()Alice: To self
